# Repository-root ignore rules.
#
# The product's own rules live in AIMS/.gitignore, AIMS/backend/.gitignore and
# AIMS/frontend/.gitignore. Those are scoped to their own directories, so
# anything outside AIMS/ — everything under docs/, and the root itself — has to
# be listed here.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
# Belt and braces. The per-directory files already cover AIMS/**, but a stray
# .env anywhere in the tree must never be committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ------------------------------------------------------------ dependencies
node_modules/

# ------------------------------------------------------- agent tooling
# Claude Code skill definitions and local settings. Development tooling for
# whoever is editing the repository - not part of the AIMS product, and of no
# use to anyone deploying or maintaining it. Kept on disk, out of the tree.
.agents/
.claude/

# --------------------------------------------------------- editor / OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Word and Excel lock files — created beside an open document, meaningless
# to anyone else, and committed by accident more than once.
~$*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Notes from the original database build. Kept locally; not part of the
# handover — it describes the build process, not the delivered system.
docs/DATABASE_BUILD_NOTES.md
